WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:27.034
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:27.304 --> 00:30.907
(Francesca Next Door)

3
00:32.976 --> 00:34.578
(All names of people, places, events, and other details are fictitious.)

4
00:34.644 --> 00:35.912
(AI-based technology was used in part of the production.)

5
00:36.947 --> 00:37.948
What's this now?

6
00:38.014 --> 00:39.015
What's wrong?

7
00:39.716 --> 00:40.717
Just...

8
00:41.418 --> 00:42.419
Just one bite.

9
00:42.819 --> 00:43.820
What?

10
00:46.656 --> 00:48.325
Hey, snap out of it!

11
00:49.292 --> 00:51.228
Why are you...

12
00:51.828 --> 00:52.829
Na Young!

13
01:00.003 --> 01:01.004
Are you a vampire?

14
01:07.511 --> 01:08.512
You have...

15
01:09.713 --> 01:12.215
red eyes and sharp fangs.

16
01:13.717 --> 01:14.718
Hey...

17
01:15.385 --> 01:17.888
You're a vampire, right?

18
01:29.099 --> 01:31.101
I know I'm right. You must be a vampire.

19
01:31.167 --> 01:33.270
You drink blood, sleep in a coffin, and die from a stake to the heart.

20
01:34.371 --> 01:36.206
Anyone would die from that.

21
01:36.773 --> 01:38.375
Do you want to test it?

22
01:38.742 --> 01:39.743
No.

23
01:40.210 --> 01:41.278
I was just...

24
01:45.181 --> 01:46.249
What's wrong?

25
01:46.850 --> 01:47.851
Do you feel sick?

26
01:48.785 --> 01:49.786
Is it a fever?

27
02:14.277 --> 02:15.345
Hey!

28
02:16.046 --> 02:17.447
What are you trying to do?

29
02:17.747 --> 02:18.982
What did I even do?

30
02:21.051 --> 02:23.119
That was too...

31
02:24.788 --> 02:25.789
Too what?

32
02:27.557 --> 02:28.758
Too perverted!

33
02:30.193 --> 02:31.494
"Perverted?"

34
02:33.697 --> 02:35.031
Hey, Pi Na Young!

35
02:49.746 --> 02:50.914
So she's a vampire?

36
02:54.284 --> 02:58.455
The speaker's self-reflection is central to this piece.

37
02:59.022 --> 03:00.757
As he looks back on his life,

38
03:00.824 --> 03:03.827
he resolves to live with a clear conscience.

39
03:04.728 --> 03:05.929
And toward the end...

40
03:05.996 --> 03:08.398
She's supposed to be a vampire,

41
03:10.300 --> 03:12.202
but she's perfectly fine in the sun.

42
03:14.471 --> 03:15.572
- Hey. - What?

43
03:16.640 --> 03:18.508
Is this yours?

44
03:20.143 --> 03:21.811
I thought I'd lost it.

45
03:22.712 --> 03:23.713
Thanks.

46
03:26.916 --> 03:28.652
Dear Father God...

47
03:30.220 --> 03:31.221
Amen.

48
03:35.925 --> 03:37.060
Amen.

49
03:39.095 --> 03:40.897
And she's not afraid of crosses.

50
03:51.408 --> 03:53.677
She even eats garlic like it's nothing.

51
04:04.821 --> 04:05.955
Nothing.

52
04:06.556 --> 04:07.557
Eat some more.

53
04:19.369 --> 04:20.370
Attention.

54
04:20.970 --> 04:23.206
All right, safety first.

55
04:23.506 --> 04:25.642
- All clear? - Yes, sir!

56
04:25.709 --> 04:28.411
- Let's do this! - Let's do this!

57
04:31.147 --> 04:32.182
Throw it hard.

58
04:35.985 --> 04:37.153
She caught that?

59
04:37.220 --> 04:38.388
- Really? - Wow, that's awesome.

60
04:38.455 --> 04:40.123
- She caught it. - Amazing.

61
04:40.190 --> 04:41.891
- Okay, throw it over there. - Right there.

62
04:45.762 --> 04:47.630
- Nice! - Nice!

63
04:53.203 --> 04:55.038
- You should've caught it. - It was too fast.

64
04:59.409 --> 05:00.877
Go to the back.

65
05:02.078 --> 05:03.079
You've got this!

66
05:03.613 --> 05:05.048
- Let's go! - Let's go!

67
05:31.141 --> 05:33.443
Why is everyone taking this so seriously?

68
05:35.845 --> 05:37.380
Here. Good luck.

69
05:42.352 --> 05:43.520
U Ju is out.

70
05:43.586 --> 05:44.587
Replay!

71
05:49.526 --> 05:51.127
- Do it again. - You've got this.

72
05:51.194 --> 05:53.096
- Let's go, Na Young! - Do it!

73
05:53.563 --> 05:54.564
Let's get it!

74
06:11.681 --> 06:12.715
Ji A!

75
06:12.782 --> 06:13.917
Oh, no!

76
06:14.717 --> 06:15.718
Are you okay?

77
06:16.319 --> 06:18.288
- It hurts. - Ji A?

78
06:18.655 --> 06:20.623
- She's bleeding. - Her nose...

79
06:20.690 --> 06:22.592
- That looks painful. - She was hit hard.

80
06:27.897 --> 06:30.033
You did this to me!

81
06:42.278 --> 06:44.380
It's all because of you!

82
06:49.986 --> 06:50.987
No.

83
06:51.054 --> 06:53.356
This can't happen now.

84
07:05.201 --> 07:08.171
Oh, please do something about this.

85
07:08.238 --> 07:10.340
- Give me a mirror. - A mirror?

86
07:10.573 --> 07:12.675
Na Young, let's get out of here.

87
07:12.742 --> 07:14.377
You still look pretty.

88
07:15.712 --> 07:16.713
It's blood.

89
07:19.048 --> 07:21.751
Oh, I am pretty with a nosebleed. But still...

90
07:21.818 --> 07:23.319
Girl, you're still pretty.

91
07:23.386 --> 07:25.521
- Guys, do something. - Help me out.

92
07:25.588 --> 07:26.890
- Please... - Help me up.

93
07:36.699 --> 07:37.934
That was dangerous.

94
07:38.935 --> 07:40.536
Do I even have to take care of that?

95
07:44.207 --> 07:45.208
Pi Na Young?

96
07:46.309 --> 07:47.310
Get it together.

97
07:47.810 --> 07:48.811
Are you okay?

98
07:53.883 --> 07:55.685
Yeah, I'm okay.

99
07:56.452 --> 07:57.453
Thanks.

100
07:58.254 --> 08:00.823
Let's go back in then.

101
08:13.569 --> 08:14.570
That felt weird.

102
08:15.371 --> 08:17.507
I wasn't even looking at his neck this time.

103
08:26.649 --> 08:27.884
Meet me in front of the gate.

104
08:34.457 --> 08:35.458
Hey, miss.

105
08:35.892 --> 08:36.893
Miss?

106
08:37.160 --> 08:38.161
What do you want?

107
08:38.628 --> 08:39.796
We were just wondering...

108
08:40.596 --> 08:45.101
if you've been struggling with sudden urges lately.

109
08:46.202 --> 08:47.203
How did you know?

110
08:47.537 --> 08:48.738
I knew it.

111
08:49.405 --> 08:51.240
There's such clarity in your eyes.

112
08:52.575 --> 08:54.911
I can sense your ancestors watching over you.

113
08:55.611 --> 08:57.380
- My ancestors? - That's right.

114
08:57.714 --> 09:00.283
You have naturally good energy,

115
09:01.017 --> 09:06.656
but lingering ancestral spirits can change your fate.

116
09:07.256 --> 09:08.257
But...

117
09:09.192 --> 09:10.460
how far back do you mean by ancestors?

118
09:10.994 --> 09:11.995
Pardon?

119
09:12.061 --> 09:13.796
A thousand years ago isn't too far back, right?

120
09:13.863 --> 09:15.064
What about ten thousand?

121
09:18.334 --> 09:22.271
How about treating us to coffee in exchange for some guidance?

122
09:22.605 --> 09:23.906
Are you free right now?

123
09:24.273 --> 09:25.274
Na Young.

124
09:26.843 --> 09:27.944
Hey, class president.

125
09:28.011 --> 09:29.746
What are you up to? Let's go.

126
09:30.546 --> 09:32.582
Apparently, these two know about my ancestors.

127
09:36.052 --> 09:37.854
Don't listen to that crap. Just follow me.

128
09:38.454 --> 09:39.989
We have so much to study.

129
09:43.793 --> 09:46.629
Why are you listening to them?

130
10:09.452 --> 10:10.453
Class president.

131
10:11.287 --> 10:12.288
What?

132
10:13.623 --> 10:15.958
Aren't I beautiful?

133
10:18.661 --> 10:19.662
What?

134
10:19.729 --> 10:20.797
I'm talking about my face.

135
10:20.863 --> 10:23.032
I think my features are well-balanced and striking.

136
10:24.233 --> 10:25.268
What do you think?

137
10:26.102 --> 10:27.804
I've never looked at you that closely.

138
10:28.337 --> 10:30.873
Then take a good look now.

139
10:34.110 --> 10:35.111
What do you say?

140
10:38.748 --> 10:40.650
You have an intense look.

141
10:42.051 --> 10:44.020
Is that all you can say? Nothing else?

142
10:49.792 --> 10:50.993
Your eye makeup is heavy.

143
10:56.632 --> 10:58.468
Where are you going? Are you done studying?

144
11:03.172 --> 11:04.474
What's wrong with her?

145
11:30.566 --> 11:31.634
Gosh, I can't sleep.

146
11:33.569 --> 11:34.670
What's going on with me?

147
11:35.972 --> 11:37.006
That's your appetite.

148
11:39.709 --> 11:40.710
What?

149
11:40.776 --> 11:42.311
Since you've already tasted his blood,

150
11:43.179 --> 11:45.081
you see him as nothing but food now.

151
11:46.716 --> 11:51.087
But my heart doesn't race around other people.

152
11:52.321 --> 11:54.557
Some people smell unusually appetizing.

153
11:56.759 --> 11:57.760
Pi Na Young.

154
12:00.530 --> 12:01.764
We're predators.

155
12:02.498 --> 12:05.801
We may live among them, but we're not equals.

156
12:06.235 --> 12:09.705
Wolves and bunnies only get along in fairy tales.

157
12:15.778 --> 12:17.079
We should stick to our own kind.

158
12:19.148 --> 12:21.684
Well, I'll test it out myself.

159
12:43.839 --> 12:45.141
What now?

160
12:46.075 --> 12:47.243
Let's meet up this weekend.

161
12:47.643 --> 12:48.678
What?

162
12:48.744 --> 12:50.279
You promised you'd be my guide.

163
12:50.713 --> 12:53.182
I want to find out what humans do for fun.

164
12:53.249 --> 12:55.251
But our mock exam is coming up soon.

165
12:56.886 --> 12:59.255
Did you finish the homework?

166
13:02.925 --> 13:05.795
Look. I finished up to page 122.

167
13:07.363 --> 13:08.664
Well, you sure did.

168
13:10.499 --> 13:11.634
Great.

169
13:11.701 --> 13:13.236
Then you agreed to this.

170
13:13.836 --> 13:15.705
I'll be at your place at 2 p.m.

171
13:16.839 --> 13:19.642
But it's just for tomorrow.

172
13:19.942 --> 13:20.943
One day is enough.

173
13:34.290 --> 13:35.725
Your eye makeup is heavy.

174
13:41.731 --> 13:42.732
I lost weight.

175
13:42.798 --> 13:45.735
Jeez, do you eat salads behind our backs?

176
13:45.801 --> 13:46.802
Why would I?

177
13:46.869 --> 13:47.870
- Salads? - Yeah.

178
13:48.838 --> 13:49.839
I'll go on a diet tomorrow.

179
13:52.908 --> 13:56.345
That freak just wouldn't miss a day in school.

180
13:56.412 --> 13:57.847
That's what I'm saying.

181
13:58.147 --> 13:59.415
She's looking at us.

182
13:59.482 --> 14:01.317
Don't you dare make eye contact.

183
14:02.118 --> 14:04.053
I swear, I'm not scared of her.

184
14:04.120 --> 14:05.321
But she's coming this way.

185
14:06.389 --> 14:07.423
This can't be real.

186
14:07.490 --> 14:08.724
She's getting closer.

187
14:09.659 --> 14:11.827
- Is she coming to me? - I think so. Why?

188
14:15.498 --> 14:16.499
Hey, Grass.

189
14:16.999 --> 14:18.000
What?

190
14:18.601 --> 14:19.602
What do you want?

191
14:20.603 --> 14:22.805
Let's meet this weekend.

192
14:23.406 --> 14:24.407
Okay.

193
14:25.808 --> 14:26.809
Wait, what?

194
14:27.043 --> 14:28.077
Let's meet up.

195
14:33.549 --> 14:34.583
Okay.

196
14:35.851 --> 14:36.852
Okay.

197
14:44.760 --> 14:46.996
Don't be nervous, girls.

198
14:47.363 --> 14:48.564
Ji A, why are you shaking?

199
14:48.631 --> 14:49.965
What are you talking about?

200
14:50.232 --> 14:51.300
Wait.

201
14:51.367 --> 14:52.368
What's wrong?

202
14:53.736 --> 14:54.904
She's over there.

203
14:58.341 --> 14:59.542
What do we do now?

204
14:59.608 --> 15:00.943
Should I hit first?

205
15:01.844 --> 15:02.845
Hold on.

206
15:07.750 --> 15:08.751
Grass!

207
15:39.849 --> 15:42.852
How do you do this thing?

208
15:45.221 --> 15:46.322
What thing?

209
15:46.756 --> 15:48.023
Korean makeup.

210
15:49.091 --> 15:50.393
I think it's pretty.

211
15:58.801 --> 15:59.869
She called you pretty.

212
16:00.503 --> 16:01.570
Who, me?

213
16:02.037 --> 16:03.672
What the heck? I know that, but...

214
16:08.043 --> 16:09.278
So what?

215
16:09.345 --> 16:10.513
Why are you doing this?

216
16:10.579 --> 16:13.682
Can you do the same thing on my face?

217
16:15.484 --> 16:17.686
Well, that's not hard.

218
16:26.662 --> 16:29.098
You're definitely a Cool Summer.

219
16:29.565 --> 16:30.599
This is your color.

220
16:30.933 --> 16:32.034
- Lip. - Lip.

221
16:37.706 --> 16:38.707
Press your lips.

222
16:41.010 --> 16:42.578
Cool. It looks good on you.

223
16:42.878 --> 16:46.282
With a face like yours, a makeover will be worth the effort.

224
16:47.049 --> 16:48.451
Next is...

225
16:50.052 --> 16:51.053
Shading brush.

226
16:52.288 --> 16:53.289
Brush.

227
16:57.626 --> 16:58.627
Nose brush.

228
17:23.886 --> 17:26.789
I don't want to say this, but you look gorgeous.

229
17:32.361 --> 17:33.362
Beautiful.

230
17:34.463 --> 17:35.598
Take a look for yourself.

231
17:36.765 --> 17:37.766
Mirror.

232
17:44.340 --> 17:45.341
Hey, Grass.

233
17:45.708 --> 17:47.910
You do have some talent after all.

234
17:51.547 --> 17:52.615
I do you a favor,

235
17:53.382 --> 17:55.251
and that's what I get.

236
17:57.286 --> 17:58.287
So are you meeting...

237
17:59.488 --> 18:00.489
the class president?

238
18:01.657 --> 18:02.658
How did you know?

239
18:04.894 --> 18:07.897
I just get it without you saying a word.

240
18:09.198 --> 18:10.466
Are you going on a date?

241
18:14.937 --> 18:16.338
I'm just testing something out.

242
18:17.339 --> 18:19.208
I have to find out if I want to drink him,

243
18:20.209 --> 18:21.477
or if it's something else.

244
18:22.845 --> 18:23.846
"Drink him?"

245
18:24.613 --> 18:25.614
Oh, my.

246
18:26.048 --> 18:27.049
- Wait... - Drink?

247
18:27.116 --> 18:28.851
Is that even appropriate?

248
18:29.518 --> 18:31.921
Oh, maybe it's because she's lived overseas.

249
18:31.987 --> 18:33.522
She's surprisingly open-minded.

250
18:34.156 --> 18:35.157
That's what it is.

251
18:36.525 --> 18:37.526
Thanks, anyway.

252
18:37.593 --> 18:39.528
I'll make sure to return the favor.

253
18:41.931 --> 18:42.998
Wait up.

254
18:43.632 --> 18:46.302
Don't tell me you're going on a date...

255
18:47.036 --> 18:48.037
in that outfit.

256
18:48.637 --> 18:49.638
For real?

257
18:54.577 --> 18:56.412
Jeez, what's taking her so long?

258
19:02.351 --> 19:04.019
- Hey. - Why are you so late...

259
19:34.416 --> 19:35.417
Why?

260
19:35.985 --> 19:36.986
Do I look weird?

261
19:38.554 --> 19:41.023
No, you don't, but...

262
19:41.690 --> 19:43.392
Then do I look pretty?

263
19:43.459 --> 19:44.493
Well...

264
19:46.395 --> 19:47.396
Anyway...

265
19:50.833 --> 19:51.900
What's that?

266
19:51.967 --> 19:52.968
Today's plan.

267
19:54.970 --> 19:56.839
We might as well go all out for it.

268
19:57.473 --> 19:59.875
I've planned out every hour,

269
20:00.442 --> 20:01.610
so just follow my lead.

270
20:03.379 --> 20:05.180
Okay, so what's first?

271
20:09.385 --> 20:10.386
Follow me.

272
20:16.759 --> 20:18.527
This movie is number one at the box office...

273
20:18.594 --> 20:20.596
and has a 4.5 critic rating.

274
20:20.663 --> 20:22.431
So it's both critically acclaimed and popular...

275
20:26.301 --> 20:27.302
Are you listening?

276
20:28.737 --> 20:29.738
I want to watch this one.

277
20:35.377 --> 20:37.813
- This one's obviously boring... - It looks fun.

278
20:37.880 --> 20:38.881
I want to.

279
20:41.116 --> 20:42.317
(Whispering Water)

280
20:42.384 --> 20:43.385
Fine.

281
20:54.329 --> 20:55.397
What?

282
20:56.598 --> 20:57.599
Where did he go?

283
20:58.567 --> 20:59.768
Don't do this.

284
21:08.711 --> 21:09.845
What the heck?

285
21:09.912 --> 21:10.913
She's so loud.

286
21:13.148 --> 21:14.917
I'm sorry.

287
21:15.584 --> 21:16.585
I'm sorry.

288
21:45.280 --> 21:46.281
Be quiet.

289
21:47.783 --> 21:48.784
Be quiet.

290
22:04.433 --> 22:06.068
(Whispering Water)

291
22:11.473 --> 22:12.574
Was that funny for you?

292
22:12.975 --> 22:14.376
Was it not?

293
22:15.377 --> 22:17.679
It's my fault for holding you to human standards.

294
22:18.447 --> 22:19.448
Whatever.

295
22:19.882 --> 22:20.983
It was fun.

296
22:21.049 --> 22:22.518
So what's next?

297
22:23.118 --> 22:24.119
Wait a moment.

298
22:28.290 --> 22:29.625
Next is...

299
22:35.764 --> 22:37.499
Oh, it's fish!

300
22:38.066 --> 22:39.067
They look delicious.

301
22:39.935 --> 22:40.936
We don't eat these.

302
22:41.336 --> 22:43.305
- And... - Hey, look at that one.

303
22:43.372 --> 22:45.140
It's super flat.

304
22:45.741 --> 22:47.176
That's a stingray.

305
22:47.676 --> 22:49.278
You know so many things.

306
22:49.812 --> 22:51.780
Has it ever occurred to you that you don't know anything?

307
22:52.414 --> 22:54.316
That's why you're here to show me.

308
22:55.284 --> 22:57.052
- That's true, but... - Wow, check that out!

309
23:32.688 --> 23:35.457
Hey, we have to leave now to get to the next place.

310
24:02.251 --> 24:03.252
Did you say something?

311
24:05.721 --> 24:06.722
Never mind.

312
24:09.658 --> 24:11.159
There are penguins over there.

313
24:11.460 --> 24:13.362
Penguins? I love them!

314
24:13.462 --> 24:14.463
Let's go!

315
24:26.174 --> 24:27.242
It's bitter.

316
24:27.309 --> 24:28.744
Why do humans drink this?

317
24:29.211 --> 24:30.913
You drink it for the aroma, not the taste.

318
24:31.480 --> 24:33.048
And you wanted to try it.

319
24:33.282 --> 24:34.750
I didn't know it'd be bitter.

320
24:34.816 --> 24:35.817
Let's switch.

321
24:42.791 --> 24:43.792
What's wrong?

322
24:43.859 --> 24:45.460
It's itchy here.

323
24:46.695 --> 24:47.763
Is it a mosquito bite?

324
24:49.164 --> 24:50.165
A mosquito?

325
24:54.803 --> 24:55.804
I got it.

326
24:56.138 --> 24:57.873
Jeez, it really filled up.

327
25:01.009 --> 25:02.144
I'm jealous.

328
25:03.912 --> 25:04.913
What?

329
25:09.351 --> 25:10.385
Never mind.

330
25:12.020 --> 25:13.021
What did she say?

331
25:20.796 --> 25:22.030
- Class president. - Yeah?

332
25:22.798 --> 25:23.799
I'm hungry.

333
25:25.000 --> 25:26.468
I was wondering when you'd say that.

334
25:27.235 --> 25:28.236
Hold on.

335
25:28.804 --> 25:33.175
I've pinned all the good restaurants around this area, so don't worry.

336
25:36.211 --> 25:37.212
Wait a second.

337
25:57.966 --> 26:00.435
Look at you, walking around with this stuck to you.

338
26:09.511 --> 26:10.645
What was that for?

339
26:11.646 --> 26:12.714
I can't do this anymore.

340
26:12.781 --> 26:14.850
Wait right here for a minute.

341
26:15.650 --> 26:16.818
What is it?

342
26:23.658 --> 26:24.659
Your wallet.

343
26:25.360 --> 26:26.528
- Mine? - Yeah.

344
26:27.896 --> 26:28.897
Why?

345
26:29.865 --> 26:31.233
Thanks, I'll be right back.

346
26:34.870 --> 26:35.871
What the heck?

347
26:47.382 --> 26:49.551
- What's that for? - Don't move.

348
26:53.055 --> 26:54.389
Why are you doing this?

349
26:58.193 --> 26:59.995
Nice. You should wear this.

350
27:00.295 --> 27:01.430
Now I'm relieved.

351
27:03.999 --> 27:05.167
(Good Quality)

352
27:05.233 --> 27:06.234
"Good quality?"

353
27:07.702 --> 27:08.904
Let's go eat.

354
27:10.572 --> 27:11.573
Pi Na Young.

355
27:19.014 --> 27:20.649
Just talk to me already.

356
27:23.385 --> 27:24.386
About what?

357
27:25.320 --> 27:26.488
The reason for all this.

358
27:27.489 --> 27:28.924
You've been acting weird all day.

359
27:30.158 --> 27:31.893
What do you mean?

360
27:31.960 --> 27:33.795
I mean, you're already weird,

361
27:34.396 --> 27:36.932
but you've been on another level these past two days.

362
27:37.866 --> 27:39.367
Tell me what's going on.

363
27:45.974 --> 27:47.109
If I do,

364
27:48.343 --> 27:49.511
will you tell me?

365
27:51.279 --> 27:52.280
What?

366
27:53.048 --> 27:55.383
Well, you always know everything.

367
27:58.453 --> 28:01.523
If I tell you what's wrong with me now,

368
28:03.291 --> 28:05.494
will you tell me the answer?

369
28:10.632 --> 28:12.200
I have no idea what you mean,

370
28:12.634 --> 28:13.735
but if you tell me,

371
28:14.202 --> 28:16.938
I might not know the answer, but I can tell you something.

372
28:22.644 --> 28:23.645
I think...

373
28:30.886 --> 28:31.887
I think...

374
28:34.055 --> 28:35.123
You think?

375
28:40.829 --> 28:41.830
I think...

376
28:48.870 --> 28:49.905
Restroom.

377
28:51.072 --> 28:52.073
What?

378
28:53.742 --> 28:54.743
I need to use the restroom.

379
28:59.414 --> 29:00.582
Go ahead.

380
29:01.149 --> 29:02.150
I'll be back.

381
29:12.594 --> 29:14.062
Where did she even get this?

382
29:16.831 --> 29:18.233
Are you having fun?

383
29:18.300 --> 29:19.301
What?

384
29:27.442 --> 29:28.843
Were you talking to me?

385
29:30.312 --> 29:32.581
Yeah, I was.

386
29:34.749 --> 29:36.785
Jang U Ju, you're the only one here.

387
29:39.054 --> 29:40.055
Do you know me?

388
29:40.822 --> 29:43.658
To be exact, I know you because Pi Na Young knows you.

389
29:44.259 --> 29:45.260
What?

390
29:51.099 --> 29:52.100
You...

391
29:53.435 --> 29:54.436
No way.

392
29:55.637 --> 29:58.740
You don't think Pi Na Young is the only vampire in the world, do you?

393
30:01.142 --> 30:02.777
What's your point?

394
30:03.645 --> 30:05.714
You should push her back.

395
30:06.314 --> 30:07.315
What?

396
30:09.918 --> 30:11.820
This is what you are to her.

397
30:12.821 --> 30:14.122
Easy to suck on.

398
30:15.757 --> 30:18.260
Sweet, only to vanish in a moment.

399
30:20.695 --> 30:21.696
What is this about?

400
30:23.465 --> 30:24.499
So what?

401
30:26.401 --> 30:27.402
I just...

402
30:29.037 --> 30:31.206
I just feel sorry for you,

403
30:31.273 --> 30:33.375
all wrapped up so beautifully.

404
30:34.042 --> 30:35.143
That's why I'm telling you.

405
30:37.479 --> 30:39.914
Anyway, I warned you.

406
30:40.815 --> 30:42.284
The rest is up to you.

407
30:43.918 --> 30:44.919
Bye.

408
31:18.086 --> 31:19.087
I'm back.

409
31:26.961 --> 31:27.962
Hey.

410
31:28.596 --> 31:29.698
I knew something was off.

411
31:33.401 --> 31:35.170
Is this what you wanted in the first place?

412
31:37.005 --> 31:38.373
- What? - My blood.

413
31:40.075 --> 31:42.010
Is that what you wanted from the start?

414
31:43.144 --> 31:44.446
What are you saying?

415
31:44.512 --> 31:46.081
Don't pretend like you don't know.

416
31:50.118 --> 31:51.119
Unbelievable.

417
31:52.087 --> 31:53.388
I had no idea.

418
31:56.224 --> 31:57.258
It's not like that.

419
31:59.427 --> 32:00.428
Then what?

420
32:02.464 --> 32:03.932
Should I thank you for saving me for later?

421
32:03.998 --> 32:04.999
Hey.

422
32:08.303 --> 32:10.705
Then prove it to me.

423
32:13.942 --> 32:14.943
Here.

424
32:16.344 --> 32:17.345
It's what you want.

425
32:21.049 --> 32:23.118
Why not? Isn't it what you want?

426
32:29.391 --> 32:30.392
I just...

427
32:32.360 --> 32:34.162
wanted to be with...

428
32:50.678 --> 32:51.679
So that was it.

429
32:52.981 --> 32:54.015
I was right.

430
32:55.350 --> 32:56.351
It's not.

431
32:56.418 --> 32:57.652
Then why?

432
32:58.253 --> 32:59.254
I just...

433
33:01.923 --> 33:02.924
I just...

434
33:29.117 --> 33:30.118
Are you a vampire?

435
33:30.418 --> 33:32.253
You see him as nothing but food now.

436
33:44.766 --> 33:45.934
Pi Na Young?

437
33:51.906 --> 33:53.441
I said it wasn't like that.

438
34:30.512 --> 34:33.448
(Francesca Next Door)
